                <note rend="inline" type="source">890g.01/220: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Great
                        Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Dawes</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-10-19T14:00:00-05:00">October 19, 1929—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>277. Department’s No. 259, September 26, 11 a.m. Is there likely to be delay in
                    receiving the Iraqi communication regarding Article 28 of the Public Education
                    Law?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
